    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051101.0326\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 2 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nCPPCC vice-chairman meets Austrian defence minister\n\n\n\n\nWang Zhongyu, vice-chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference (CPPCC), met here Wednesday with Austrian Defence Minister Gunther Platter.\n\nPlatter and his party arrived in Beijing Monday for an official visit to China at the invitation of his Chinese counterpart Cao Gangchuan.",
